<title>SPAIN: Spanish bond yields little lower at auction.</title>
<headline>Spanish bond yields little lower at auction.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the following results at today's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid, allocated in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p>    ISSUE     Yield    Pvs     Price     Pvs   Bid   Allocated</p>
<p>3-year     6.829    7.054   97.100  101.65    419.65  190.00</p>
<p>10-year    7.804    7.950  111.200  109.50    345.75  126.68</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
